msgid "ARK RTK Base"
msgstr "ARK RTK 基站"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ark-rtk-base.rst:12
#: f7cc3464948a4c66bacae11bfd3a2f17
msgid ""
"Open source Ublox ZED-F9P RTK GPS module. The ARK RTK Base is a high "
"precision GPS module that can be used as a base station for RTK GPS systems."
" It is compatible with ArduPilot and can be used with the RTK GPS module to "
"provide high precision GPS data for drones."
msgstr ""
"开源 Ublox ZED-F9P RTK GPS 模块。ARK RTK 基站是一款高精度 GPS 模块，可用作 RTK GPS 系统的基站。它与 "
"ArduPilot 兼容，可与 RTK GPS 模块配合使用，为无人机提供高精度 GPS 数据。"

